checkpoint.description:
Checkpoint (event/property listings only): narrow to items that reach one pipeline location. Unwired/dangling → no items + a warning, never an error. Tagged object by `kind`:
- { kind: "source", sourceId }
- { kind: "gatewayInput", gatewayId, inputId }
- { kind: "gateway", gatewayId }
- { kind: "gatewayOutput", gatewayId, outputId }
- { kind: "destination", destinationId }
Resolve ids via get/search; inputId/outputId from get(type:"gateway", id).inputs[].id / outputs[].id.

